# "nedelja" names BOTH the weekday Sunday and (dialectally/dictionary-wise)
# the week -- Wiktionary marks the week sense secondary/regional and
# sr.wikipedia treats sedmica as the unmarked "week" word.  This locale
# resolves the ambiguity by CONSTRUCTION, not by guessing: nedelja binds only
# the weekday slot (WEEKDAY == Sunday, as in "u nedelju"), and the duration
# unit is sedmica alone (unit_week.voc/unit1_week.voc) -- nedelja never enters
# a duration reading, so "nedelju dana" refuses rather than silently picking a
# sense.  Wiktionary, nedelja -- https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nedelja#Serbo-Croatian
nedelja
недеља
nedelju
недељу
nedelje
недеље
